OL,3,GNEWSARobbers jailed after violent
OL,4,Atwo-day 'rampage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves who went on a 48-hour criminal
OL,7,F"rampage" through Leeds have been
OL,8,Fjailed.
OL,10,FLee Wakefield, 41 and Jessica Stewart,
OL,11,F28, carried out a series of violent
OL,12,Foffences across the city centre over a
OL,13,Ftwo-day period in February.
OL,15,FDuring one break-in the pair left one
OL,16,Fof the occupants with a broken arm,
OL,17,Ffractured leg and fractured ribs, while
OL,18,Fanother suffered a head injury.
OL,20,FThey were both jailed at Leeds Crown
OL,21,FCourt on Tuesday after pleading guilty
OL,22,Fto a string of offences.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
